        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0235-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because \"determination\" was translated as ketsui elsewhere in the Japanese script, this machine was renamed the \"KTI Extraction Machine\". This peculiar abbreviation comes from how ketsui is spelled in the Japanese script: ケツイ (Ke Tsu I).",
        "raw": "Because \"determination\" was translated as ketsui elsewhere in the Japanese\nscript, this machine was renamed the \"KTI Extraction Machine\". This peculiar\nabbreviation comes from how ketsui is spelled in the Japanese script:\n7\"\"/1 (Ke Tsu I).",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en",
          "ja"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09895215,
          0.32768571,
          0.70294249,
          0.39587857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09659206,
          0.32697143,
          0.70495966,
          0.39695
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          23,
          24,
          25,
          26
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "日文剧本的其他地方把 determination 译成了 ketsui（决心），因此这台机器也改名为“KTI 提取机”。这个特别的缩写来自游戏里 ketsui 的写法：「ケツイ」（Ke Tsu I），各取一个字母。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
