    {
      "id": "p0235-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This simple localization change offers another example of how a single localization choice in one part of a script can unexpectedly affect other parts. Such unexpected side effects can easily be missed by machine translation systems, rushed translators using primitive \"search-and-replace\" tools, or inexperienced translators.",
        "raw": "This simple localization change offers another example of how a single\nlocalization choice in one part of a script can unexpectedly affect other parts.\nSuch unexpected side effects can easily be missed by machine translation\nsystems, rushed translators using primitive \"search-and-replace\" tools, or\ninexperienced translators.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09895215,
          0.41075714,
          0.68639163,
          0.4961
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09659206,
          0.41004286,
          0.70495966,
          0.49717143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          27,
          28,
          29,
          30,
          31
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这个简单的改动再次说明，剧本某一处的翻译选择，可能意外影响其他地方。机器翻译、用简陋“查找替换”工具赶工的译者，或经验不足的译者，都很容易漏掉这类连带影响。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
